  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Extension and refurbishment of the Municipal Building in Gjakov&#xBF;/&#xBF;akovica - Lot 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Lot 2 contains the major part of the works of the construction project. Lot 1 contains the complementary part of the project&apos;s works and is the subject of a contract signed by the Municipality of Gjakov&#xEB;/&#xD0;akovica.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;The initial design envisaged refurbishment of the existing building. Soon after the start of the works it was revealed that refurbishment is not an option due to depreciation of the building structure. The design was changed to new construction of the entire municipal building.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
